# Studio master archive — 2.8 GB of 4K camera originals and print-resolution
# artwork. Read by scripts/build-media.mjs and never served: everything the
# site loads is derived into public/media/, which IS committed. GitHub rejects
# any file over 100MB and eight of these masters exceed it.
/assets
